### Contact Feature UI Routes Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/contact

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/contact
@name = John Doe
@email = john@example.com
@message = Hello, this is a test message for the contact form.

### 1. Send Contact Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "{{message}}"
}

###

### 2. Send Contact Message with Long Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "This is a longer message that contains more detailed information about the user's inquiry. It should still be within the 2000 character limit and provide a good test case for the contact form functionality."
}

###

### 3. Send Contact Message with Arabic Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "أحمد محمد",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "مرحباً، هذه رسالة تجريبية للنموذج. أريد أن أتأكد من أن النظام يدعم النصوص العربية بشكل صحيح."
}

###

### 4. Test with Invalid Email (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "message": "{{message}}"
}

###

### 5. Test with Empty Name (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "{{message}}"
}

###

### 6. Test with Name Too Short (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "{{message}}"
}

###

### 7. Test with Message Too Short (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "message": "Short"
}

###

